little as 7 days"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"In three separate placebo-controlled, clinical trials involving 86 participants, consumption of 12.5 g of Litesse Fiber in a pre-meal beverage resulted in a statistically significant reduction in caloric intake in a subsequent test meal (lunch). The subjects' breakfast meal was controlled, as was the nutritional profile of the test beverage.\nIn a randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled, crossover trial, where 83 individuals took a daily dose of 1.37 g B-GOS and placebo for 14 days each, during which B-GOS subjects experienced statistically significant improvements in bloating and digestive comfort at the 7- and 14-day time points, compared to placebo."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Clinically Studied"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Clinically shown to reduce food intake\nHelps you to eat less and wait longer between meals"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Excellent source of fiber plus prebiotics for digestive health"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Natural & artificial flavor"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: As a dietary supplement, add one scoop to 8 to 10 fl. oz. of water, mix thoroughly and enjoy twice daily. For optimal hunger support benefits, take both servings together 60-90 minutes before our largest meal of the day. Consume with adequate amounts of water."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Milk"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Contributes a trivial amount of sugar."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No sugar"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Bimuno, B-GOS and the Bimuno ICON are registered trademarks of Clasado IP Limited and are p